</details>$help_tokens$);
select pg_temp.add_tokens_block('propose_en', $help_tokens$<details data-v="tokens"><summary>Tokens of appreciation</summary>
<p>Credits pay for tasks; tokens say thank you for a gift. When your proposal is published, you receive tokens by its pages, or by its minutes for audio and video. They are given by themselves and are never money. Proposals published before tokens existed count too. You find them in <b>My Space</b>, with how many times your text has been opened.</p>
<p>If you approve proposals, check that the pages or the minutes are filled in: the tokens are counted from them. If a published proposal turns out to be a copy of a text already in the archive, tell Reward. Only Reward annuls tokens, with a note.</p>
</details>$help_tokens$);
select pg_temp.add_tokens_block('propose_it', $help_tokens$<details data-v="tokens"><summary>Tokens of appreciation</summary>
